cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TeDiServe, please cite the paper below."
title: "TeDiServe"
abstract: >-
  TeDiServe is a cluster-level serving system for diffusion language models
  that targets high latency-SLO attainment through deadline-aware scheduling,
  confidence-threshold-based load control, and cluster reconfiguration.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
